    {
      "reviewtitle": "the man, the myth",
      "reviewbody": "This is gold. What a legend. The rest of this show must be in a vault somewhere. ",
      "stars": "0",
      "reviewer": "rockthing",
      "reviewdate": "2020-09-28 03:45:19",
      "createdate": "2020-09-28 03:45:19",
      "reviewer_itemname": "@rockthing"
    },
    {
      "reviewtitle": "Lovelight",
      "reviewbody": "The first 2/3-rds sounds like a Lovelight jam, with Neil rapping as opposed to Pig. He even mentions getting Pig's mic on. Interesting.",
      "stars": "0",
      "reviewer": "jakevito",
      "reviewdate": "2021-06-26 00:09:47",
      "createdate": "2021-06-26 00:09:47",
      "reviewer_itemname": "@jakevito"
    },
    {
      "reviewtitle": "Progression of Lovelight",
      "reviewbody": "From the Anthem studio sessions (15 takes of Lovelight, played in a totally different fashion) to this to 8-5-67.. I would like to hear the details of how they got it to the version we know, how many times did they play it that wasnt recorded, or lost recordings. I love this song so much and would just love to know the secret history.",
      "stars": "5",
      "reviewer": "Captskullybones",
      "reviewdate": "2021-08-24 19:25:57",
      "createdate": "2021-08-24 19:25:57",
      "reviewer_itemname": "@captskullybones"
    },
    {
      "reviewtitle": "neil at the wheel",
      "reviewbody": "great to hear a sample of cassidy's rap! wish we could hear the rest of lovelight, as the recording ends... having seen it performed live w/Pig at the helm, I've no doubt that this was an ALL-time version!",
      "stars": "5",
      "reviewer": "srfnsom",
      "reviewdate": "2023-08-28 18:25:54",
      "createdate": "2023-08-28 18:25:54",
      "reviewer_itemname": "@srfnsom"
    }
  ],
